{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015162036292-1015_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261015162434\"/><p>救援人員抵達學校。</p><p>巴基斯坦西北部城市白沙瓦周四（15日）發生學校屋頂坍塌事故，造成至少27名兒童和1名教師喪生。救援人員稱，仍有數名兒童困在瓦礫下，傷亡人數可能繼續增加。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:43:35.123228+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:20:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:57:50.964842+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:38.514090+00:00","content_hash":"7dff6b34513c267832d8993479e954dd0ed87e29b40d70763c5b05c5909d780f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}